WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.217
Look straight up.

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:06.525
The star at the top of the sky is
Polaris, the North Star, less than a

00:00:06.525 --> 00:00:07.983
degree from overhead.

00:00:08.433 --> 00:00:12.656
The Earth's axis points almost
straight at it, so from here it

00:00:12.656 --> 00:00:13.541
hardly moves.
